      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看见队伍成员们表情顺从地点了头，\n小小蚕茧拿出了一本笔记本。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3db8f715d3c0f1735efc1b44a00994550e42cddb6f3fe8ae7e684efa682f50e",
